      "uid": "zhcn:32838038d1a7bdad9d1714bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们在夏季合宿中稳步积蓄着力量，\n已经成为了让人感受到威胁的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77215009e406298aa9669773a1e70fbef2a8ace46fca7d674fffc00e5617b829",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
