    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88401e5e2f0a20fec8637356",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听说，当时西沙里奥刚开始怀抱梦想的时候，\n父母曾经带她去看了喜剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9297c837a09018fe6e3bae3a6bee077dc25ebba601b877a291e68642d7f51bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
